{"seq":1,"slug":"testability-mocking","title":"可测试性与 Mock","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/testability-mocking","wordCount":1044,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可测试性与-mock\">可测试性与 Mock</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>依赖注入的首要工程价值在于使单元测试变得可行且轻松。当所有依赖通过构造器注入时，测试中只需传入 Mock/Stub/Fake 对象即可完全隔离被测单元——无需启动容器、无需连接真实数据库、无需等待网络响应。正确的 DI 设计使测试从&quot;秒级+不稳定&quot;变为&quot;毫秒级+确定性&quot;，关键是只 Mock 直接依赖的接口边界而非深层实现细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"di-对测试的变革性影响\">DI 对测试的变革性影响</h2><p>依赖注入的首要工程价值不是&quot;代码更优雅&quot;，而是<strong>让单元测试变得可行</strong>。当类通过构造函数接收所有依赖时，测试中只需传入 Mock/Stub 对象即可完全隔离被测单元——无需启动容器、无需连接真实数据库、无需等待网络响应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;无 DI:测试困难&quot;&#10;        T1[测试 OrderService] --&gt; DB[(真实数据库)]&#10;        T1 --&gt; Net[真实网络]&#10;        T1 --&gt; FS[真实文件系统]&#10;        DB -.- Slow[慢: 秒级]&#10;        Net -.- Flaky[不稳定: 网络抖动]&#10;        FS -.- Env[环境依赖: 路径/权限]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;有 DI:测试轻松&quot;&#10;        T2[测试 OrderService] --&gt; MockRepo[Mock Repository]&#10;        T2 --&gt; MockPricing[Mock PricingEngine]&#10;        MockRepo -.- Fast[快: 微秒级]&#10;        MockPricing -.- Stable[稳定: 确定性行为]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"无 DI:测试困难\"\n        T1[测试 OrderService] --&gt; DB[(真实数据库)]\n        T1 --&gt; Net[真实网络]\n        T1 --&gt; FS[真实文件系统]\n        DB -.- Slow[慢: 秒级]\n        Net -.- Flaky[不稳定: 网络抖动]\n        FS -.- Env[环境依赖: 路径/权限]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"有 DI:测试轻松\"\n        T2[测试 OrderService] --&gt; MockRepo[Mock Repository]\n        T2 --&gt; MockPricing[Mock PricingEngine]\n        MockRepo -.- Fast[快: 微秒级]\n        MockPricing -.- Stable[稳定: 确定性行为]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试维度</th>\n<th>无 DI</th>\n<th>有 DI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行速度</td>\n<td>秒~分钟（真实 I/O）</td>\n<td>毫秒（内存操作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>受环境/网络影响</td>\n<td>确定性结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离性</td>\n<td>多个测试共享数据库状态</td>\n<td>每个测试完全隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设置成本</td>\n<td>需要 Docker/种子数据</td>\n<td>直接 new + Mock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行能力</td>\n<td>可能死锁/竞争</td>\n<td>无共享状态，天然并行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试中的-mock-策略\">单元测试中的 Mock 策略</h2><p>构造器注入使得 Mock 注入极为自然——直接在测试中 new 出被测对象并传入 Mock 依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"describe(&#39;OrderService&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  let service: OrderService;&#10;  let mockRepo: jest.Mocked&lt;IOrderRepository&gt;;&#10;  let mockPricing: jest.Mocked&lt;IPricingEngine&gt;;&#10;&#10;  beforeEach(() =&gt; {&#10;    // 创建 Mock 对象&#10;    mockRepo = {&#10;      save: jest.fn(),&#10;      findById: jest.fn(),&#10;    };&#10;    mockPricing = {&#10;      calculate: jest.fn().mockReturnValue(new Money(100)),&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    // 直接 new —— 无需容器&#10;    service = new OrderService(mockRepo, mockPricing);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should calculate total and save order&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const cart = new Cart([item(&#39;book&#39;, 2)]);&#10;    mockRepo.save.mockResolvedValue(new Order(&#39;ord-1&#39;, cart));&#10;&#10;    const result = await service.createOrder(cart);&#10;&#10;    expect(mockPricing.calculate).toHaveBeenCalledWith(cart);&#10;    expect(mockRepo.save).toHaveBeenCalled();&#10;    expect(result.id).toBe(&#39;ord-1&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mockRepo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Mocked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IOrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mockPricing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Mocked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IPricingEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  beforeEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 创建 Mock 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mockRepo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      save: jest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      findById: jest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mockPricing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      calculate: jest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mockReturnValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 直接 new —— 无需容器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    service </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockRepo, mockPricing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should calculate total and save order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'book'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mockRepo.save.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mockResolvedValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ord-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cart));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockPricing.calculate).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveBeenCalledWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockRepo.save).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveBeenCalled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.id).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ord-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Mock vs Stub vs Fake 的选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mock</td>\n<td>验证交互行为（方法被调用了几次、传了什么参数）</td>\n<td>验证副作用（发送邮件、发布事件）</td>\n<td><code>verify(sender).send(email)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stub</td>\n<td>返回预设值，不验证交互</td>\n<td>提供测试数据</td>\n<td><code>when(repo.find(id)).thenReturn(order)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fake</td>\n<td>简化但可工作的实现</td>\n<td>替代复杂基础设施</td>\n<td><code>InMemoryOrderRepository</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"避免过度-mock\">避免过度 Mock</h2><p>过度 Mock 是 DI 测试中最常见的反模式。当测试 Mock 了太多依赖的内部行为时，测试变成了对实现细节的测试，而非对行为的测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 反模式：过度 Mock 导致测试与实现耦合&#10;@Test&#10;void testCreateOrder_overMocked() {&#10;    // Mock 了 pricing 的每个内部步骤&#10;    when(mockTax.calculate(any())).thenReturn(new Money(10));&#10;    when(mockDiscount.apply(any())).thenReturn(new Money(5));&#10;    when(mockPricing.combine(any(), any())).thenReturn(new Money(95));&#10;&#10;    // 如果 PricingEngine 重构内部实现，这个测试就挂了&#10;    // 但 OrderService 的行为根本没变&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：Mock 到接口边界&#10;@Test&#10;void testCreateOrder_properly() {&#10;    // 只 Mock OrderService 直接依赖的接口行为&#10;    when(mockPricing.calculate(cart)).thenReturn(new Money(95));&#10;    when(mockRepo.save(any())).thenAnswer(inv -&gt; inv.getArgument(0));&#10;&#10;    Order result = service.createOrder(cart);&#10;&#10;    assertThat(result.total()).isEqualTo(new Money(95));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反模式：过度 Mock 导致测试与实现耦合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testCreateOrder_overMocked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Mock 了 pricing 的每个内部步骤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockTax.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockDiscount.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockPricing.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">combine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果 PricingEngine 重构内部实现，这个测试就挂了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 但 OrderService 的行为根本没变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：Mock 到接口边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testCreateOrder_properly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 只 Mock OrderService 直接依赖的接口行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockPricing.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockRepo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenAnswer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(inv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getArgument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Order result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    assertThat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isEqualTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>经验法则</strong>：只 Mock 被测对象的<strong>直接依赖</strong>（构造函数参数），不 Mock 依赖的依赖。如果你发现需要 Mock 三层以上的调用链，说明接口抽象层次有问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"接口设计与可测试性\">接口设计与可测试性</h2><p>DI 让 Mock 注入成为可能，但接口设计决定了 Mock 是否容易写：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;难以 Mock 的接口&quot;&#10;        Fat[IOrderService: 20个方法]&#10;        Fat -.- Problem1[测试只用 1 个方法但必须实现 20 个]&#10;        Fat -.- Problem2[Mock 设置冗长]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;易于 Mock 的接口&quot;&#10;        Slim1[IOrderCreator: createOrder]&#10;        Slim2[IOrderQuery: findById/list]&#10;        Slim3[IOrderCanceller: cancel]&#10;        Slim1 -.- Good1[测试只 Mock 需要的那个]&#10;        Slim2 -.- Good2[接口隔离原则]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"难以 Mock 的接口\"\n        Fat[IOrderService: 20个方法]\n        Fat -.- Problem1[测试只用 1 个方法但必须实现 20 个]\n        Fat -.- Problem2[Mock 设置冗长]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"易于 Mock 的接口\"\n        Slim1[IOrderCreator: createOrder]\n        Slim2[IOrderQuery: findById/list]\n        Slim3[IOrderCanceller: cancel]\n        Slim1 -.- Good1[测试只 Mock 需要的那个]\n        Slim2 -.- Good2[接口隔离原则]\n    end</pre><p><strong>可测试性设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>接口隔离</strong>：小而聚焦的接口比大而全的接口更易 Mock</li>\n<li><strong>命令-查询分离</strong>：写操作（Command）和读操作（Query）分开接口，测试时只 Mock 需要的一侧</li>\n<li><strong>避免 Header Interface</strong>：不要为每个类都创建一个一对一的接口——只在确实需要多态替换（包括测试替换）时才提取接口</li>\n<li><strong>Null Object 模式</strong>：为可选依赖提供无操作的默认实现，减少测试中的 Mock 数量</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试中的容器使用\">集成测试中的容器使用</h2><p>集成测试需要验证多个组件协同工作的行为，此时可以使用真实的 DI 容器但替换外部依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// ASP.NET Core 集成测试：用 WebApplicationFactory 替换外部服务&#10;public class OrderApiTests : IClassFixture&lt;WebApplicationFactory&lt;Program&gt;&gt;&#10;{&#10;    private readonly HttpClient _client;&#10;&#10;    public OrderApiTests(WebApplicationFactory&lt;Program&gt; factory)&#10;    {&#10;        _client = factory.WithWebHostBuilder(builder =&gt;&#10;        {&#10;            builder.ConfigureServices(services =&gt;&#10;            {&#10;                // 替换真实数据库为内存数据库&#10;                services.RemoveAll&lt;DbContextOptions&lt;AppDbContext&gt;&gt;();&#10;                services.AddDbContext&lt;AppDbContext&gt;(opts =&gt;&#10;                    opts.UseInMemoryDatabase(&quot;TestDb&quot;));&#10;&#10;                // 替换外部支付网关为 Fake&#10;                services.RemoveAll&lt;IPaymentGateway&gt;();&#10;                services.AddSingleton&lt;IPaymentGateway, FakePaymentGateway&gt;();&#10;            });&#10;        }).CreateClient();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [Fact]&#10;    public async Task CreateOrder_ReturnsCreatedStatus()&#10;    {&#10;        var response = await _client.PostAsJsonAsync(&quot;/api/orders&quot;, new { ... });&#10;        Assert.Equal(HttpStatusCode.Created, response.StatusCode);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ASP.NET Core 集成测试：用 WebApplicationFactory 替换外部服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderApiTests : IClassFixture&#x3C;WebApplicationFactory&#x3C;Program>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly HttpClient _client;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public OrderApiTests(WebApplicationFactory&#x3C;Program> factory)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _client = factory.WithWebHostBuilder(builder =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            builder.ConfigureServices(services =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 替换真实数据库为内存数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                services.RemoveAll&#x3C;DbContextOptions&#x3C;AppDbContext>>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                services.AddDbContext&#x3C;AppDbContext>(opts =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    opts.UseInMemoryDatabase(\"TestDb\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 替换外部支付网关为 Fake</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                services.RemoveAll&#x3C;IPaymentGateway>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                services.AddSingleton&#x3C;IPaymentGateway, FakePaymentGateway>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }).CreateClient();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Fact]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public async Task CreateOrder_ReturnsCreatedStatus()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var response = await _client.PostAsJsonAsync(\"/api/orders\", new { ... });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Assert.Equal(HttpStatusCode.Created, response.StatusCode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Test as 集成测试&#10;    participant Factory as WebApplicationFactory&#10;    participant Container as DI 容器(测试配置)&#10;    participant API as API Controller&#10;    participant Fake as FakePaymentGateway&#10;&#10;    Test-&gt;&gt;Factory: 创建测试服务器(替换外部依赖)&#10;    Factory-&gt;&gt;Container: 注册 Fake 替代品&#10;    Test-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/orders&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 OrderService(真实) + PaymentGateway(Fake)&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;Fake: processPayment() → 返回成功&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;Test: 201 Created\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Test as 集成测试\n    participant Factory as WebApplicationFactory\n    participant Container as DI 容器(测试配置)\n    participant API as API Controller\n    participant Fake as FakePaymentGateway\n\n    Test-&gt;&gt;Factory: 创建测试服务器(替换外部依赖)\n    Factory-&gt;&gt;Container: 注册 Fake 替代品\n    Test-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/orders\n    API-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 OrderService(真实) + PaymentGateway(Fake)\n    API-&gt;&gt;Fake: processPayment() → 返回成功\n    API--&gt;&gt;Test: 201 Created</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试隔离与并行\">测试隔离与并行</h2><p>DI 的 Scoped 生命周期天然支持测试并行——每个测试创建独立的作用域，服务实例互不干扰：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"[Fact]&#10;public async Task Test1()&#10;{&#10;    using var scope = _serviceProvider.CreateScope();&#10;    var service = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService&lt;OrderService&gt;();&#10;    // 这个 scope 内的 DbContext 实例与 Test2 完全隔离&#10;}&#10;&#10;[Fact]&#10;public async Task Test2()&#10;{&#10;    using var scope = _serviceProvider.CreateScope();&#10;    var service = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService&lt;OrderService&gt;();&#10;    // 独立的 scope，独立的 DbContext&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Fact]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public async Task Test1()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    using var scope = _serviceProvider.CreateScope();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var service = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService&#x3C;OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 这个 scope 内的 DbContext 实例与 Test2 完全隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Fact]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public async Task Test2()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    using var scope = _serviceProvider.CreateScope();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var service = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService&#x3C;OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 独立的 scope，独立的 DbContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于需要数据库的集成测试，每个测试可以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用独立的内存数据库实例</li>\n<li>使用事务回滚（测试开始时开启事务，结束时回滚）</li>\n<li>使用 TestContainers 创建临时的容器化数据库</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DI 对测试的变革性影响体现在三个层面：单元测试中通过构造器直接传入 Mock 实现零摩擦隔离；集成测试中通过容器配置替换外部依赖为 Fake 实现；测试并行中通过 Scoped 生命周期实现实例级隔离。避免过度 Mock 的关键是只 Mock 被测对象的直接依赖接口，不 Mock 依赖的依赖。接口设计（小而聚焦、命令查询分离）直接决定了 Mock 的编写成本。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"anti-patterns\">反模式</a> 详解 Service Locator 等模式如何破坏可测试性。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可测试性与 Mock","id":"可测试性与-mock"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DI 对测试的变革性影响","id":"di-对测试的变革性影响"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试中的 Mock 策略","id":"单元测试中的-mock-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"避免过度 Mock","id":"避免过度-mock"},{"level":2,"text":"接口设计与可测试性","id":"接口设计与可测试性"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试中的容器使用","id":"集成测试中的容器使用"},{"level":2,"text":"测试隔离与并行","id":"测试隔离与并行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/module-boundary"},"next":{"title":"反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/anti-patterns"}}